{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36202","headline":"睦州吕郎中郡中环溪亭 · 方干","name":"睦州吕郎中郡中环溪亭","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"爲是仙才登望处，风光便似武陵春。\n闲花半落犹迷蝶，白鸟双飞不避人。\n树影兴余侵枕簟，荷香坐久着衣巾。\n暂来此地非多日，明主那容借寇恂。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"方干","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_36202.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36202","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}